  m_text: "Input a number of Mimic's to be present 'ere over at Tang's Fantastic
    Farmplex\u2122! We'll holler 'em up over to our Mimilking\u2122 station and count
    the number of times we have to milk each Mimic! For every odd numbered Mimic
    (that has three ears), us here at Tang's Fantastic Farmplex\u2122 will milk them
    two times, and for every even numbered Mimic, us here at Tang's Fantastic Farmplex\u2122
    will milk them three times!"
